msgstr "安全模式散热"

msgid "Fan curve"
msgstr "风扇曲线"

msgid "Fan manager"
msgstr "插件接管"

msgid "Fan output"
msgstr "风扇输出"

msgid "Fan output follows the hottest sensor through a temperature curve. Kernel protection stays in charge of throttling and emergency cooling."
msgstr "风扇输出跟随最热的传感器沿温度曲线调节；内核保护始终负责降频与临界过热保护。"

msgid "Following curve"
msgstr "按曲线调节"

msgid "Holding before spin-down"
msgstr "降速等待中"

msgid "Hottest available considers CPU, Wi-Fi, Ethernet PHY and the 5G modem."
msgstr "「最热可用」会同时考虑 CPU、Wi-Fi、以太网 PHY 与 5G 模组。"

msgid "Hottest available sensor"
msgstr "最热的可用传感器"

msgid "Hottest channel: %s"
msgstr "最热通道：%s"

msgid "Hottest one drives the fan"
msgstr "最热的一路驱动风扇"

msgid "Kernel"
msgstr "内核"

msgid "Kernel control"
msgstr "内核控制"

msgid "Kernel only"
msgstr "仅内核"

msgid "Kernel protection only"
msgstr "仅内核保护"

msgid "Kernel safety floor"
msgstr "内核安全下限"

msgid "Kernel thermal protection is always retained; the effective output may be raised above the request when the kernel needs more cooling."
msgstr "内核热保护始终保留；当内核需要更多散热时，实际输出可能高于请求值。"

msgid "Manual"
msgstr "手动"

msgid "Manual PWM output"
msgstr "手动 PWM 输出"

msgid "Manual setting"
msgstr "手动设定"

msgid "No valid sensor"
msgstr "无有效传感器"

msgid "Not detected"
msgstr "未检测到"

msgid "Not exposed by this radio driver"
msgstr "该无线驱动未暴露温度"

msgid "Operating mode"
msgstr "运行模式"

msgid "Performance"
msgstr "性能"

msgid "Pick a profile or a fixed output. Safety limits stay active in every mode."
msgstr "选择曲线或固定输出。任何模式下安全限制都生效。"

msgid "Policy"
msgstr "策略"

msgid "Prevents repeated speed changes around a curve point."
msgstr "避免在曲线拐点附近反复调速。"

msgid "Query the radio driver"
msgstr "向无线驱动查询"

msgid "Quiet"
msgstr "静音"

msgid "Radio driver statistics"
msgstr "无线驱动统计"

msgid "Raw PWM"
msgstr "PWM 原始值"

msgid "Requested"
msgstr "请求"

msgid "Requires MT5700 Console"
msgstr "需要 MT5700 Console"

msgid "Response & safety"
msgstr "响应与安全"

msgid "Running normally"
msgstr "运行正常"

msgid "Seconds between control decisions. The dashboard refreshes independently."
msgstr "两次控制决策之间的秒数；页面刷新是独立的。"

msgid "Seconds between radio-driver queries. The dashboard refresh does not query the driver."
msgstr "两次向无线驱动查询的间隔秒数；页面刷新不会触发查询。"

msgid "Sensor failsafe"
msgstr "传感器异常，已进入安全模式"

msgid "Shared with kernel"
msgstr "内核与插件共用"

msgid "Speed-down delay"
msgstr "降速延迟"

msgid "Startup boost PWM"
msgstr "启动助推 PWM"

msgid "Startup boost duration"
msgstr "启动助推时长"

msgid "Status delayed"
msgstr "状态延迟"

msgid "Temperature hysteresis"
msgstr "温度滞回"

msgid "Temperature sensors"
msgstr "温度传感器"

msgid "Temperatures must increase from 0–150 °C and percentages must be 0–100."
msgstr "温度须在 0–150 °C 内递增，百分比须在 0–100 之间。"

msgid "The MT7992 exposes its chip temperature only through private driver statistics, so it is polled at a throttled rate and cached."
msgstr "MT7992 只在私有驱动统计里暴露芯片温度，因此按节流间隔查询并缓存。"

msgid "The fan manager owns the fan policy. Kernel CPU throttling and critical over-temperature protection stay active."
msgstr "插件独占风扇策略；内核的 CPU 降频与临界过热保护仍然生效。"

msgid "The kernel safety floor may raise the effective output above this value."
msgstr "内核安全下限可能把实际输出抬到该值之上。"

msgid "Thermal owner"
msgstr "热控归属"

msgid "Use comma-separated temperature:percent points, for example 35:0,45:50,70:80,90:100."
msgstr "请使用逗号分隔的「温度:百分比」，例如 35:0,45:50,70:80,90:100。"

msgid "Via MT5700 Console"
msgstr "经 MT5700 Console"

msgid "Wait this many seconds before lowering output; temperature increases apply immediately."
msgstr "降速前等待的秒数；温度上升会立即生效。"

msgid "When disabled, the fan follows the kernel thermal protection level only."
msgstr "关闭后风扇只跟随内核热保护档位。"

msgid "Wi-Fi poll interval"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 查询间隔"

msgid "Wi-Fi temperature"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 温度"

msgid "hwmon node"
msgstr "hwmon 节点"

msgid "thermal zone"
msgstr "thermal zone"
